使用者問題：
新聞說最近有餐廳食安問題，我想先看雙北食品抽驗合格率和不合格比例。

可用元件清單：
{
  "guide_area": "food_health",
  "components": [
    {
      "module_id": "food_inspection",
      "title": "食品抽驗合格率",
      "query_type": "percent",
      "safe_use": "Route food-safety questions to official inspection trend data. Do not judge a single product or store.",
      "forbidden_claims": [
        "單一店家安全",
        "單一商品安全",
        "這間店危險"
      ]
    },
    {
      "module_id": "pharmacy_access",
      "title": "藥局資源分布概況",
      "query_type": "two_d",
      "safe_use": "Guide users to pharmacy resource distribution. Do not provide medication advice.",
      "forbidden_claims": [
        "建議吃藥",
        "自行用藥",
        "服用抗生素"
      ]
    },
    {
      "module_id": "medical_access",
      "title": "急診待診人數和等候時間",
      "query_type": "three_d",
      "safe_use": "Guide users to ER access and congestion data. Warn users to call 119 for emergencies.",
      "forbidden_claims": [
        "最快醫院",
        "一定有床",
        "不用就醫",
        "診斷為食物中毒"
      ]
    },
    {
      "module_id": "water_quality",
      "title": "淨水場水質檢測概況",
      "query_type": "two_d",
      "safe_use": "Summarize official water-quality monitoring coverage. Do not claim household tap water is safe or unsafe.",
      "forbidden_claims": [
        "你家水安全",
        "你家水危險",
        "可以直接飲用"
      ]
    },
    {
      "module_id": "eco_restaurant",
      "title": "環保餐廳分布概況",
      "query_type": "two_d",
      "safe_use": "Guide users to official eco restaurant distribution. Do not judge a single restaurant's food safety.",
      "forbidden_claims": [
        "這間店安全",
        "這間店危險",
        "這家一定衛生"
      ]
    }
  ]
}

資料內容：
[
  {
    "module_id": "food_inspection",
    "component_title": "食品抽驗合格率",
    "query_type": "percent",
    "database_context": {
      "status": "success",
      "categories": [
        "臺北市",
        "新北市"
      ],
      "data": [
        {
          "name": "合格率",
          "data": [
            96,
            94
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "不合格率",
          "data": [
            4,
            6
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  }
]

請依照固定 schema，只輸出 JSON。

